8
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:40,870
You can directly say that three phase power can be measured by using two wattmeter method.
你可以直接说，三相功率可以用二功率表法来测量。

9
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:48,150
Okay, it is suitable for balanced load and unbalanced load.
好，它适用于平衡负载和不平衡负载。

10
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:55,150
So, two wattmeter method is more than sufficient to measure three phase power.
所以二功率表法完全足以测量三相功率。

11
00:00:55,150 --> 00:00:58,150
Second question, what is two wattmeter method?
第二个问题：什么是二功率表法？

12
00:00:58,150 --> 00:01:08,150
We are going to connect two wattmeter at any two lines and the total power we are providing
我们把两块功率表接在任意两根线上，至于我们提供的总功率，

13
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:14,150
if it is star connection, we are going to provide the supply voltage of 400 volt.
如果是星形连接，我们会提供 400 伏的电源电压。

14
00:01:14,150 --> 00:01:18,150
Afterwards, we are providing the load and we are giving the load.
然后我们接上负载，给出负载。

15
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:23,150
Then we will come to know that how much power is consumed by the particular load.
这样我们就能知道这个负载消耗了多少功率。

16
00:01:23,150 --> 00:01:30,150
Therefore, the total power consumed by the load that can be written as sum of two wattmeter
因此，负载消耗的总功率可以写成两块功率表

17
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:33,150
W1 and W2.
W1 和 W2 读数之和。

18
00:01:33,150 --> 00:01:37,150
It measures real power only, that point you have to remember.
它只测量有功功率，这一点你们要记住。

19
00:01:37,150 --> 00:01:42,620
Write down the equation for measuring three phase power.
写出测量三相功率的公式。

20
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:44,620
You can write in two ways.
可以有两种写法。

21
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:50,620
The first way, in terms of line quantity, the three phase power can be written as
第一种，用线量表示，三相功率可以写成

22
00:01:50,620 --> 00:02:08,620
three into Vl iL cos phi or in terms of phase quantity three into V phase into i phase into cos phi
3 乘以 VL IL cos φ；或者用相量表示，3 乘以相电压乘以相电流乘以 cos φ，

23
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:10,620
where cos phi is known as power factor.
其中 cos φ 叫做功率因数。

24
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:14,620
So, these are the equation for three phase power.
这些就是三相功率的公式。

25
00:02:14,620 --> 00:02:16,620
It is actually called real power only.
它实际上就是有功功率。

26
00:02:16,620 --> 00:02:20,620
If you want to write a reactive power, what you would do?
如果要写无功功率，你会怎么写？

27
00:02:20,620 --> 00:02:33,580
You can write Q is equal to root three Vl iL sin phi or else in terms of phase quantity
可以写成 Q 等于根号三 VL IL sin φ，或者用相量表示，

28
00:02:33,580 --> 00:02:39,580
three V phase i phase into sin phi.
3 乘以相电压乘以相电流乘以 sin φ。

29
00:02:39,580 --> 00:02:42,580
Correct.
对。

30
00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:47,580
Then for question, how do you calculate the power factor of a three phase load?
然后第四个问题：怎样计算三相负载的功率因数？

31
00:02:47,580 --> 00:02:53,580
So, using two wattmeter method, it is very easy to calculate power factor.
用二功率表法计算功率因数非常容易。

32
00:02:53,580 --> 00:02:57,580
Anyway, you will be getting the reading of W1 and W2.
反正你会得到 W1 和 W2 的读数。

33
00:02:57,580 --> 00:03:01,580
First, what you will do is, you will be calculating the tan phi.
首先你要做的是计算 tan φ。

34
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:13,580
Tan phi can be calculated using the formula root three into W2 minus W1 by W1 plus W2.
tan φ 可以用公式计算：根号三乘以 W2 减 W1，除以 W1 加 W2。

35
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:17,580
From this, you need to calculate phi.
由此你需要算出 φ。

36
00:03:17,580 --> 00:03:31,370
Phi is equal to tan inverse of root three into W2 minus W1 by W1 plus W2.
φ 等于根号三乘以 W2 减 W1 除以 W1 加 W2 的反正切。

37
00:03:31,370 --> 00:03:34,370
From this, you can directly take a cos phi.
由此可以直接得到 cos φ。

38
00:03:34,370 --> 00:03:50,350
That is nothing but cosine of tan inverse root three into W2 minus W1 divided by
也就是根号三乘以 W2 减 W1 除以

39
00:03:50,350 --> 00:03:53,350
W1 plus W2.
W1 加 W2 的反正切的余弦。

40
00:03:53,350 --> 00:03:55,350
Like this, you can write.
可以这样写。

